---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import '../../styles/comparison.css';
import '../../styles/promo.css';
import '../../styles/modules.css';
---

<Layout title="The Men's Divorce Hypnosis System | Audio Program" simpleHeader={true}>
    



    <!-- Hero Section with ORIGINAL Dark/Grid Background -->
    <header id="hero" class="section hero-section" style="min-height: auto; padding-top: 2rem; position: relative; padding-bottom: 6rem;">
        <div class="container" style="max-width: 1400px;">
            <div class="hero-content">
                <h1
                    style="font-size: 4rem; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; text-shadow: 0 2px 4px rgba(0,0,0,0.5); line-height: 1.15; color: #fff;">
                    Rewire Your Subconscious for<br>
                    <span style="color: var(--color-neon);">Confidence & Peace</span>
                </h1>
                <p
                    style="font-size: 1.5rem; margin-bottom: 3rem; color: var(--color-text-light); font-weight: 600; line-height: 1.4;">
                    The 7-Day Audio Hypnosis Protocol to Break the Trauma Loop and Reclaim Your Edge.<br>
                    <span style="color: var(--color-text-muted); font-size: 1.25rem; font-weight: 400;">Bypass the logic. Attack the biology. Rebuild from the inside out.</span>
                </p>


                <!-- Video Placeholder -->
                <div class="hero-video-wrapper">
                    <div class="video-container" style="border: 2px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1); box-shadow: 0 30px 60px rgba(0,0,0,0.5);">
                        <iframe id="vsl-video" width="100%" height="100%"
                            src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/YOUR_VIDEO_ID?rel=0&modestbranding=1"
                            title="Men's Post Divorce Hypnosis System VSL" frameborder="0"
                            allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share"
                            allowfullscreen
                            style="position: absolute; top: 0; left: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%;"></iframe>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- "Low Ticket Profits" Format White Card -->
            <div style="background: #fff; border-radius: 12px; padding: 4rem; color: #1a1a1a; box-shadow: 0 40px 100px rgba(0,0,0,0.4); margin-top: 4rem; display: flex; gap: 4rem; align-items: stretch; text-align: left; max-width: 1350px; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;">
                
                <!-- Left: Sales Copy in LTP Format -->
                <div style="flex: 1.2; padding-right: 2rem;">
                    <p style="font-size: 1.35rem; line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; color: #333;">
                        What if you could actually <strong>stop reacting</strong> to your past — while <strong>rebuilding your identity</strong> (not just masking the pain) from Day 1?
                    </p>
                    <p style="font-size: 1.35rem; line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 2rem; color: #333;">
                        That's exactly why I created the <strong>Men's Divorce Hypnosis System</strong> — a series of targeted audio protocols designed to settle the nervous system and <strong>install a new identity</strong> while you sleep.
                    </p>
                    
                    <p style="font-size: 1.5rem; font-style: italic; text-decoration: underline; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 3rem; color: #000;">
                        This Isn't Theory. This Is What's Working Right Now.
                    </p>

                    <div style="margin-bottom: 3rem;">
                        <div style="display: flex; gap: 1.5rem; margin-bottom: 2rem; align-items: flex-start;">
                            <div style="background: var(--color-accent); color: #fff; width: 30px; height: 30px; border-radius: 4px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 1rem; font-weight: 900;">✓</div>
                            <span style="font-size: 1.3rem; line-height: 1.4; color: #333;">Forget the generic advice. This isn't another "get over it" pep talk filled with recycled clichés.</span>
                        </div>
                        <div style="display: flex; gap: 1.5rem; margin-bottom: 2rem; align-items: flex-start;">
                            <div style="background: var(--color-accent); color: #fff; width: 30px; height: 30px; border-radius: 4px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 1rem; font-weight: 900;">✓</div>
                            <span style="font-size: 1.3rem; line-height: 1.4; color: #333;">This is the <strong>7-session protocol</strong> I use to help men stop the 'replay' loop and start moving with the 100% certainty that their best days are <strong>ahead of them.</strong></span>
                        </div>
                        <div style="display: flex; gap: 1.5rem; margin-bottom: 2rem; align-items: flex-start;">
                            <div style="background: var(--color-accent); color: #fff; width: 30px; height: 30px; border-radius: 4px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 1rem; font-weight: 900;">✓</div>
                            <span style="font-size: 1.3rem; line-height: 1.4; color: #333;">This is the <strong>exact protocol</strong> to settle the chaos in your head and start moving with the 100% certainty that your best days are <strong>ahead of you, not behind you.</strong></span>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- Right: EXACT SHOPPING CART STYLE FROM IMAGE -->
                <div style="flex: 0.8; max-width: 480px; background-color: var(--color-text-muted); border-radius: 12px; padding: 2.5rem; align-self: start; box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.05);">
                    <div class="checkout-container" style="background: transparent; border: none; box-shadow: none; padding: 0;">
                        <!-- White Order Summary Box -->
                        <div style="background: #fff; border: 1px solid #ddd; border-radius: 8px; padding: 2rem; margin-bottom: 2.5rem;">
                            <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 1rem; font-size: 1.1rem; color: #555;">
                                <span>Audio Hypnosis System</span>
                                <span>$47.00</span>
                            </div>
                            <div style="border-top: 1px solid #eee; margin: 1rem 0;"></div>
                            <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; font-size: 1.75rem; font-weight: 800; color: #2c3e50;">
                                <span>Total Today:</span>
                                <span>$47.00</span>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <div class="form-group" style="margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">
                            <label for="full-name-hero" style="display: block; margin-bottom: 0.75rem; font-weight: 700; color: #2c3e50; font-size: 1rem;">Full Name</label>
                            <input type="text" id="full-name-hero" placeholder="Enter your full name" style="width: 100%; padding: 1.25rem; border: 1px solid #ddd; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 1.1rem; background: #fff;" required>
                        </div>
                        
                        <div class="form-group" style="margin-bottom: 2.5rem;">
                            <label for="email-hero" style="display: block; margin-bottom: 0.75rem; font-weight: 700; color: #2c3e50; font-size: 1rem;">Email Address</label>
                            <input type="email" id="email-hero" placeholder="Enter your email address" style="width: 100%; padding: 1.25rem; border: 1px solid #ddd; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 1.1rem; background: #fff;" required>
                        </div>

                        <button class="btn btn-checkout" onclick="proceedToStripeCheckout('hero')" style="width: 100%; background: #5cb85c; color: #fff; padding: 1.75rem; font-size: 1.4rem; font-weight: 800; border: none; border-radius: 8px; cursor: pointer; text-transform: uppercase; box-shadow: 0 4px 0 #449d44; transition: all 0.2s;">
                            PROCEED TO SECURE CHECKOUT - $47 →
                        </button>

                        <!-- Trust Signals Section -->
                        <div style="margin-top: 2.5rem; text-align: center;">
                            <!-- 30-Day Money Back -->
                            <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: 1.25rem; margin-bottom: 2rem;">
                                <!-- Gold Badge Seal -->
                                <div style="width: 85px; height: 85px; position: relative; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C5A059 0%, #E2C17D 50%, #C5A059 100%); border-radius: 50%; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; border: 2px solid #fff; box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.15);">
                                    <div style="position: absolute; top: -4px; left: -4px; right: -4px; bottom: -4px; border: 3px dotted #C5A059; border-radius: 50%;"></div>
                                    <div style="text-align: center; color: #fff; font-family: sans-serif; z-index: 1;">
                                        <div style="font-size: 8px; letter-spacing: 0.5px; opacity: 0.9;">★★★★</div>
                                        <div style="font-size: 16px; font-weight: 900; line-height: 1;">100%</div>
                                        <div style="font-size: 8px; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.1; margin: 2px 0;">MONEY BACK</div>
                                        <div style="font-size: 8px; letter-spacing: 0.5px; opacity: 0.9;">★★★★</div>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                                <!-- Dashed Box Text -->
                                <div style="border: 2px dashed rgba(0,0,0,0.15); border-radius: 8px; padding: 0.75rem 1.25rem; text-align: left;">
                                    <div style="font-size: 1.3rem; font-weight: 900; color: #1a1a1a; line-height: 1.1; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: -0.5px;">30-DAY MONEY</div>
                                    <div style="font-size: 1.3rem; font-weight: 900; color: #1a1a1a; line-height: 1.1; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: -0.5px;">BACK GUARANTEE</div>
                                </div>
                            </div>

                            <!-- Security Text -->
                            <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: 0.6rem; color: #1a1a1a; font-weight: 800; font-size: 1.05rem; margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">
                                <span style="font-size: 1.1rem;">🔒</span> 100% Secure 256-Bit Encrypted Checkout
                            </div>

                            <!-- Payment Icons -->
                            <div style="display: flex; justify-content: center; align-items: center; gap: 0.8rem; opacity: 0.9;">
                                <img src="https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/5/5e/Visa_Inc._logo.svg" alt="Visa" style="height: 12px;">
                                <img src="https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/2/2a/Mastercard-logo.svg" alt="Mastercard" style="height: 18px;">
                                <img src="https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/b/b0/American_Express_logo_%282018%29.svg" alt="Amex" style="height: 16px;">
                                <img src="https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/0/04/Discover_Card_logo.svg" alt="Discover" style="height: 12px;">
                                <img src="https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/b/ba/Stripe_logo%2C_revised_2016.svg" alt="Stripe" style="height: 18px;">
                                <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 4px; background: #fff; border: 1px solid #ddd; padding: 2px 5px; border-radius: 4px; height: 18px;">
                                    <span style="color: #5cb85c; font-size: 10px;">✔</span>
                                    <span style="font-size: 9px; font-weight: 800; color: #666; text-transform: uppercase;">SECURE</span>
                                </div>
                            </div>

                            <p style="color: #888; font-size: 0.85rem; margin-top: 1.5rem;">
                                Your detailed access information will be sent to your email immediately.
                            </p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </header>

    <!-- NEW SECTION: Introducing (Tan Background Block Style) -->
    <section class="section" style="background-color: var(--color-text-muted); padding: 8rem 2rem; color: var(--color-bg-primary);">
        <div style="max-width: 900px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center;">
            <p style="font-size: 1.1rem; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; letter-spacing: 4px; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--color-accent); font-weight: 700;">INTRODUCING</p>
            <h2 style="font-size: 4rem; line-height: 1.1; margin-bottom: 2rem; color: var(--color-bg-primary); font-weight: 800;">
                The Audio Hypnosis<br>
                System
            </h2>
            <p style="font-size: 1.5rem; line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 4rem; color: var(--color-bg-primary); max-width: 800px; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; opacity: 0.9;">
                The subconscious protocol to bypass the trauma loop and install a future-focused identity.
            </p>

            <!-- Course Portal Preview -->
            <div style="position: relative; max-width: 850px; margin: 4rem auto 0;">
                <img src="/images/course-portal-preview.png" alt="Course Portal Preview" 
                    style="width: 100%; border-radius: 12px; box-shadow: 0 30px 60px rgba(0,0,0,0.15); border: 8px solid #fff;">
                <div style="margin-top: 2rem; color: var(--color-accent); font-size: 1rem; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 2px; text-transform: uppercase;">
                    ▲ ACTUAL COURSE DASHBOARD
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- NEW SECTION: Syllabus (White Background, Cards Grid Style) -->
    <section class="section" style="background-color: var(--color-text-light); padding: 8rem 2rem;">
        <div style="max-width: 1100px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center;">
            <p style="font-size: 1rem; margin-bottom: 1rem; letter-spacing: 3px; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--color-accent); font-weight: 700;">WHAT YOU'LL LEARN</p>
            <h2 style="font-size: 3.5rem; line-height: 1.2; margin-bottom: 4rem; color: var(--color-bg-primary); font-weight: 800;">
                The Syllabus
            </h2>

            <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 2.5rem; text-align: left;">
                <!-- Card 1 -->
                <div style="background-color: var(--color-text-muted); padding: 3rem; border-radius: 12px; display: flex; flex-direction: column;">
                    <div style="width: 50px; height: 50px; background-color: var(--color-bg-primary); border-radius: 8px; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; color: #fff; font-weight: 800; font-size: 1.25rem;">01</div>
                    <h4 style="font-size: 0.9rem; letter-spacing: 2px; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--color-accent); margin-bottom: 0.5rem; font-weight: 700;">SESSION 1</h4>
                    <h3 style="font-size: 1.75rem; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; color: var(--color-bg-primary); line-height: 1.2;">The Release</h3>
                    <p style="font-size: 1.05rem; line-height: 1.6; color: var(--color-text-dark); opacity: 0.8;">Severing the emotional tether to your past. This session focuses on quieting the external "noise" and reclaiming your internal narrative.</p>
                </div>

                <!-- Card 2 -->
                <div style="background-color: var(--color-text-muted); padding: 3rem; border-radius: 12px; display: flex; flex-direction: column;">
                    <div style="width: 50px; height: 50px; background-color: var(--color-bg-primary); border-radius: 8px; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; color: #fff; font-weight: 800; font-size: 1.25rem;">02</div>
                    <h4 style="font-size: 0.9rem; letter-spacing: 2px; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--color-accent); margin-bottom: 0.5rem; font-weight: 700;">SESSION 2</h4>
                    <h3 style="font-size: 1.75rem; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; color: var(--color-bg-primary); line-height: 1.2;">The Anchor</h3>
                    <p style="font-size: 1.05rem; line-height: 1.6; color: var(--color-text-dark); opacity: 0.8;">Installing immovable self-trust. We build an internal "safe house" where your decisions are based on logic and future results, not past pain.</p>
                </div>

                <!-- Card 3 -->
                <div style="background-color: var(--color-text-muted); padding: 3rem; border-radius: 12px; display: flex; flex-direction: column;">
                    <div style="width: 50px; height: 50px; background-color: var(--color-bg-primary); border-radius: 8px; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; color: #fff; font-weight: 800; font-size: 1.25rem;">03</div>
                    <h4 style="font-size: 0.9rem; letter-spacing: 2px; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--color-accent); margin-bottom: 0.5rem; font-weight: 700;">SESSION 3</h4>
                    <h3 style="font-size: 1.75rem; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; color: var(--color-bg-primary); line-height: 1.2;">The Architect</h3>
                    <p style="font-size: 1.05rem; line-height: 1.6; color: var(--color-text-dark); opacity: 0.8;">Designing the new Man. We use advanced visualization to install the habits, posture, and mindset of the man you are becoming.</p>
                </div>

                <!-- Card 4 -->
                <div style="background-color: var(--color-text-muted); padding: 3rem; border-radius: 12px; display: flex; flex-direction: column;">
                    <div style="width: 50px; height: 50px; background-color: var(--color-bg-primary); border-radius: 8px; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; color: #fff; font-weight: 800; font-size: 1.25rem;">04</div>
                    <h4 style="font-size: 0.9rem; letter-spacing: 2px; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--color-accent); margin-bottom: 0.5rem; font-weight: 700;">SESSION 4</h4>
                    <h3 style="font-size: 1.75rem; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; color: var(--color-bg-primary); line-height: 1.2;">The Shield</h3>
                    <p style="font-size: 1.05rem; line-height: 1.6; color: var(--color-text-dark); opacity: 0.8;">Emotional immune system activation. Learn it to stay calm and stoic in high-conflict situations without feeling the "sting".</p>
                </div>

                <!-- Card 5 -->
                <div style="background-color: var(--color-text-muted); padding: 3rem; border-radius: 12px; display: flex; flex-direction: column;">
                    <div style="width: 50px; height: 50px; background-color: var(--color-bg-primary); border-radius: 8px; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; color: #fff; font-weight: 800; font-size: 1.25rem;">05</div>
                    <h4 style="font-size: 0.9rem; letter-spacing: 2px; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--color-accent); margin-bottom: 0.5rem; font-weight: 700;">SESSION 5</h4>
                    <h3 style="font-size: 1.75rem; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; color: var(--color-bg-primary); line-height: 1.2;">The Magnet</h3>
                    <p style="font-size: 1.05rem; line-height: 1.6; color: var(--color-text-dark); opacity: 0.8;">Shifting into the abundace state. Rewiring how you view opportunities, relationships, and your own value in the world.</p>
                </div>


            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Comparison Section -->
    <section class="section comparison-section">
        <div class="container">
            <h2 style="font-size: 2.5rem; margin-bottom: 3rem; text-align: center;">
                Here's what changes when you start <br>
                <span style="color: var(--color-neon);">The Hypnosis System</span>
            </h2>

            <div class="comparison-wrapper">
                <div class="comparison-grid">
                    <!-- Before Column -->
                    <div class="comparison-col col-before">
                        <h3>Before Hypnosis</h3>
                        <ul class="comparison-list">
                            <li class="comparison-item">
                                <div class="icon-box"><i class="fas fa-times">✕</i></div>
                                <span>Constantly stressed and reactive to her</span>
                            </li>
                            <li class="comparison-item">
                                <div class="icon-box"><i class="fas fa-times">✕</i></div>
                                <span>Endless "what ifs" with little progress</span>
                            </li>
                            <li class="comparison-item">
                                <div class="icon-box"><i class="fas fa-times">✕</i></div>
                                <span>Burned out and always behind</span>
                            </li>
                            <li class="comparison-item">
                                <div class="icon-box"><i class="fas fa-times">✕</i></div>
                                <span>Living by default (Her Frame)</span>
                            </li>
                            <li class="comparison-item">
                                <div class="icon-box"><i class="fas fa-times">✕</i></div>
                                <span>Struggling to find time for yourself</span>
                            </li>
                            <li class="comparison-item">
                                <div class="icon-box"><i class="fas fa-times">✕</i></div>
                                <span>Stuck in cycles of urgency and guilt</span>
                            </li>
                        </ul>
                    </div>

                    <!-- After Column -->
                    <div class="comparison-col col-after">
                        <h3>After Hypnosis</h3>
                        <ul class="comparison-list">
                            <li class="comparison-item">
                                <div class="icon-box"><i class="fas fa-check">✓</i></div>
                                <span>Calm, focused, and in control</span>
                            </li>
                            <li class="comparison-item">
                                <div class="icon-box"><i class="fas fa-check">✓</i></div>
                                <span>Clear outcomes and meaningful wins</span>
                            </li>
                            <li class="comparison-item">
                                <div class="icon-box"><i class="fas fa-check">✓</i></div>
                                <span>Energized and ahead of your priorities</span>
                            </li>
                            <li class="comparison-item">
                                <div class="icon-box"><i class="fas fa-check">✓</i></div>
                                <span>Living by design (Your Frame)</span>
                            </li>
                            <li class="comparison-item">
                                <div class="icon-box"><i class="fas fa-check">✓</i></div>
                                <span>Creating space for growth and fulfillment</span>
                            </li>
                            <li class="comparison-item">
                                <div class="icon-box"><i class="fas fa-check">✓</i></div>
                                <span>Operating from intention, not pressure</span>
                            </li>
                        </ul>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- About Section (Reverted to Dark Theme) -->
    <section id="about" class="section">
        <div class="container">
            <div style="max-width: 900px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; margin-bottom: 3rem;">
                <h2 style="color: var(--color-neon); margin-bottom: 1.5rem; line-height: 1.3;">
                    The System Works. <span style="color: #fff;">Make the Decision.</span>
                </h2>
            </div>

            <div class="grid-2" style="align-items: center;">
                <!-- Left Col: Bio -->
                <div>
                    <!-- Small Image Placeholder -->
                    <div
                        style="width: 150px; height: 150px; background-color: #333; border-radius: 50%; margin-bottom: 2rem; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; overflow: hidden; border: 4px solid var(--color-accent);">
                        [Alex]
                    </div>

                    <h3 style="margin-bottom: 1.5rem; color: #fff;">I'm Alex Morgan.</h3>
                    <p style="margin-bottom: 1.5rem; color: var(--color-text-muted);">
                        I've worked with hundreds of men, and I've seen the same patterns over and over. I know what
                        it's like to feel like you're doing everything right on paper, but still feel hollow inside.
                    </p>
                    <p style="margin-bottom: 1.5rem; color: var(--color-text-muted);">
                        You work endlessly, thinking more effort will fix it. But the results never match the energy
                        you're putting in.
                    </p>
                    <p style="font-weight: 600; color: var(--color-text-light); font-style: italic;">
                        But it doesn't have to be this way.
                    </p>
                </div>

                <!-- Right Col: Success/Results (Dark Card) -->
                <div class="result-card">
