                        <li style="color: var(--color-text-light);">Wake up every day with clarity and purpose — even
                            after years of feeling lost</li>
                        <li style="color: var(--color-text-light);">Create meaningful relationships and connections, and
                            still have time for the things that matter</li>
                        <li style="color: var(--color-text-light);">Build a life they're proud of — without guilt,
                            shame, or constantly looking back</li>
                        <li style="color: var(--color-text-light);">Move forward with confidence and momentum — without
                            repeating the same mistakes</li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- NEW SECTION: Pricing & Timer -->
    <section id="pricing-timer" class="section"
        style="background-color: var(--color-bg-dark); color: white; text-align: center;">
        <div class="container" style="max-width: 600px;">
            <p
                style="color: var(--color-neon); font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 1px; margin-bottom: 1rem; font-size: 1.25rem;">
